							<h1 align="center">Awards</h1> <p>Some people just rock, and what better way to show them that we notice? An award of course!&nbsp; In order to get an award, a member would nominate someone, then a minimum of 15 votes are required to be added to the wall of people who just rock!&nbsp; (This exludes MVP, as this award requires 30 votes)&nbsp; Members on probationary status are not eligble for these awards.</p> <p>Awards:</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"></v:path><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=_x0000_s1026 style="MARGIN-TOP: 6.6pt; Z-INDEX: -2; MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; WIDTH: 54.7pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 28.3pt; mso-wrap-edited: f; mso-position-horizontal: absolute; mso-position-vertical: absolute" type="#_x0000_t75" wrapcoords="-296 0 -296 21032 21600 21032 21600 0 -296 0"><v:imagedata src="file:///C:/DOCUME~1/JENNIF~1/LOCALS~1/Temp/msoclip1/01/clip_image001.png" o:title="award"></v:imagedata><?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" /><w:wrap type="tight"></w:wrap></v:shape></p> <h2 class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 68px; HEIGHT: 26px" height="27" src="/pics/1602/award.bmp" width="81" />Award of Excellence <o:p></o:p></font></span></h2> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who are excellent at what they do!<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>This may be an excellent puller, healer, slower, tank, rezzer, twitcher, ect..</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><v:shape id=_x0000_s1027 style="MARGIN-TOP: 9.8pt; Z-INDEX: -1; LEFT: 0px; MARGIN-LEFT: 36pt; WIDTH: 27pt; POSITION: absolute; HEIGHT: 20.7pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-wrap-edited: f; mso-position-horizontal: absolute; mso-position-vertical: absolute" type="#_x0000_t75" wrapcoords="-360 0 -360 21130 21600 21130 21600 0 -360 0"><v:imagedata src="file:///C:/DOCUME~1/JENNIF~1/LOCALS~1/Temp/msoclip1/01/clip_image003.png" o:title="award2"></v:imagedata><w:wrap type="tight"></w:wrap></v:shape></p> <h2 style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 65px; HEIGHT: 41px" height="41" src="/pics/1602/award2.bmp" width="79" />Medallion of Compassion</font></h2> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who show extreme caring or kindness to others.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><font size="5"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><strong><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 37px; HEIGHT: 52px" height="68" src="/pics/1602/purple.gif" width="40" />Tribute of Guardians</font></strong></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded for those who save another from a sticky situation or certain death!</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><strong><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 31px; HEIGHT: 42px" height="58" src="/pics/1602/red.bmp" width="37" />Prize of Sacrifice</font></strong></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who “take one for the team.”<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>(such as dying for the better good of a raid, for example)</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p> <h2 style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"><font size="4"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img style="WIDTH: 38px; HEIGHT: 46px" height="84" src="/pics/1602/award3.bmp" width="66" /></span>Plaque of Patience </font></h2> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded for those who show extreme patience with the guild or guildies.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><strong><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 43px; HEIGHT: 40px" height="40" src="/pics/1602/medal.bmp" width="67" />Cross of Aide </font></strong></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who are extra helpful to someone in need!</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p> <h1 style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 21px; HEIGHT: 43px" height="73" src="/pics/1602/blue.bmp" width="46" />Medallion of Leadership </font></h1> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who lead a raid or other guild event wonderfully!</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><font size="4"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><font size="4"><strong><img style="WIDTH: 34px; HEIGHT: 22px" height="35" src="/pics/1602/untitled.bmp" width="51" />Mark of Punctuality </strong></font></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who are always on time! (A minimum of 5 occasions)</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><strong><font size="4"><img style="WIDTH: 39px; HEIGHT: 37px" height="61" src="../pics/1602/ribbon1.gif" width="62" />Member of the Month </font></strong></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Awarded to those who rock!<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes"></span><font size="4"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><font size="4"><strong><img style="WIDTH: 41px; HEIGHT: 43px" height="43" src="../pics/1602/trophy1.gif" width="74" />MVP</strong> </font></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">The most valuable of all awards, this is only awarded to a member who has received at least 1 other award and requires a minimum of 20 people voting for them.</span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><a href="/forums/threadlist.aspx?fid=1554">Nominate </a>someone for an award..</span></p>
							
